# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# This is not cosmetic here. CI regenerates docs/reports/ and fails the build if the committed copy
# differs, which is what stops a number in a report going stale. Without this, a report committed
# from Windows (CRLF) differs from the same report generated on a Linux runner (LF) on every single
# line, and the check reports a whole-file diff with identical content.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sql text eol=lf
*.hl7 text eol=lf
*.ndjson text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
